  "supersession_reason": "Run 44 repairs the four participant-facing render defects Run 43J classified F, on the owner's order of 2026-08-22. What a participant is shown is executable behaviour, so the freeze is superseded rather than amended: a severity ordering that read a lowercase 'green' as more adverse than 'Green' is now case-insensitive at every site that orders a status; no surface names a module as the driver of a severity better than its own; an absent document-risk score renders as absent instead of as 0.00 Green, while a genuine stored zero still renders as zero; CPI and SPI are labelled computed rather than extracted; and the Portfolio Health flyout states that the analysis is no longer in service rather than asking for more projects. NO SERVER COMPUTATION MOVED: run_module() on all 101 identifiers returns output byte-identical to v28 on a full and a starved package, proved by executing both lines. ONE SEQUENCE-BEARING PARTICIPANT FILE MOVED, deepdive.js, deliberately and once, under the owner's order at Run 44 section 4.4; the other five are byte-identical. The v28 candidate, its identity, its gate and its release records are preserved unchanged as the historical evidence for anything computed under v28.",
